  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Member of the Ashlords, Con 13+ or Wis 13+, Favored enemy class feature or Creature Focus, Knowledge (Nature) 3 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may call on the elements to purify the enemies of the city. You may use a swift action to add +1d6 of a chosen energy type to attacks against your favored enemy to all attacks made with manufactured or natural weapons for 1 round. You may activate this feat a number of times equal to once a day plus once a day per four levels. This damage stacks with damage of the same type from another source such as a flaming weapon enchantment or aethernaut rift edge for a Fire aligned plane.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc69\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
